"Olympic swimming pools of extra ocean volume, every day, at the {0}-year rate": "piscinas olímpicas de volumen oceánico extra, cada día, al ritmo de {0} años",
"Global mean sea level, {0}–{1} (mm)": "Nivel medio global del mar, {0}–{1} (mm)",
